Package: desktop-canvas
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: mpv
Suggests: qt6-webengine-dev, qt6-declarative-dev, liblayershellqtinterface-dev
Description: Animated Wallpaper Engine wallpapers behind the Linux desktop
 Renders Wallpaper Engine workshop content (video, scene, web wallpapers)
 behind icons, widgets and taskbars on Wayland (wlr-layer-shell) and X11.
 Scene wallpapers require linux-wallpaperengine, which Debian does not
 package; build with -DDESKTOP_CANVAS_BUNDLE_LWE=ON to bundle it.
